    <shape type="text" topLeftX="84" topLeftY="132" width="340" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="16" bold="true" color="rgb(90,90,90)"><p>传统纸质溯源</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="84" topLeftY="170" width="340" height="170">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgb(90,90,90)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.9">
        <p>· 用药施肥靠手写台账</p>
        <p>· 加工批次、冷链温度写在纸上</p>
        <p>· 单据事后可涂改、不留痕</p>
        <p>· 消费者看不到真实过程</p>
        <p>· 出事各环节互相推诿</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="452" topLeftY="212" width="56" height="56"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(76,122,90)"/></fill></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="452" topLeftY="228" width="56" height="24"><content textType="body" fontSize="15" bold="true" color="rgb(255,255,255)" textAlign="center"><p>VS</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="118" width="376" height="232"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(240,245,241)"/></fill><border color="rgb(76,122,90)" width="1"/></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="540" topLeftY="132" width="336" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="16" bold="true" color="rgb(40,80,50)"><p>区块链溯源（本项目）</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="540" topLeftY="170" width="336" height="170">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgb(50,70,55)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.9">
        <p>· 每步操作录入系统并算哈希</p>
        <p>· 哈希指纹写入区块链存证</p>
        <p>· 一旦写入，无法篡改、全程留痕</p>
        <p>· 扫码即见从田间到餐桌全程</p>
        <p>· 责任环节一目了然、可自证</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="372" width="832" height="86"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(246,248,246)"/></fill><border color="rgb(76,122,90)" width="1"/></shape>
